WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.240
The roadmap advances
through evidence gates.

00:00:02.347 --> 00:00:05.280
Start with trusted assistance
and human approval.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:09.600
Connect context, evaluation
and evidence across teams

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:13.360
once the workflow is repeatable.
Consider more autonomous

00:00:13.417 --> 00:00:17.480
agents when action controls
and recovery have been demonstrated.

00:00:17.567 --> 00:00:21.840
These horizons are capability choices
rather than calendar promises.

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:27.200
Local quality, complete effort
and reliable cross-team outcomes should

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:31.360
determine the next step, not pressure
to reach a fashionable maturity label.
